[list]
[*]Fixed: a crafter on shift at a radius or area stand changed out of uniform to store each bill's product, even with the stockpile inside the ring or the area. They left the product at the bench, walked to the stand, came back for it in their own clothes and dressed again for the next bill. They now carry it to that stockpile in uniform, whether or not Hauling is ticked. Reported by a player.
[*]Unchanged: a stockpile past the edge of the ring or the area still changes them back first, and they leave the product at the bench to do it. Bills set to drop on the floor work as before, and so do room stands.
[/list]
